  id: 
  abilityName: Breakneck Rush
  description: '**Effect:** The character rushes in a straight line toward an enemy,
    striking them upon reaching an adjacent tile. Damage increases with each tile
    traveled. On a successful hit, the character gains a temporary +5 Speed boost.


    **Explanation:**
    The character closes the distance to an enemy while turning movement into offensive
    pressure. Traveling farther increases the damage potential, rewarding players
    who position themselves carefully before committing to the attack.'
